abstract: >
  Sourced JSON and CSV of official US IRA, 401(k), TSP, and SIMPLE contribution
  limits, the IRS Uniform Lifetime RMD table, and IRC 408(m) IRA-eligible metal
  rules, each row with a primary-source URL and retrieved date.
